    premise p4 : extracted diagnostic_of(beach_marks, fatigue) quote "diagnostic of progressive fatigue crack growth" at 279 snapshot "15094eaf31481fdd3e39b0d9b394bd5fec80f8b8a2f7b07b885d6b188fe32dd7" source "axle failure report" trust authoritative
